1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Paris Street Combat
G1 Bridgehead MVP

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Automated input with AI narration.
One player, two Allies, three German guards.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Animation: walking and grounded footsteps.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Sprint movement and footstep timing.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Slow walk uses a separate movement pace.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Jump and landing with in-game audio.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Crouch transition and movement.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Prone, crawl and stand on clear level ground.

9
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Collision: solid geometry blocks movement.

10
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Reload animation, mechanical audio
and ammo state work together.

11
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Navigation: cross the river using the bridge.

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Allied movement and regrouping
use Unreal navigation.

13
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:11,000
The minimap shows the squad and current goal.

14
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:19,000
NPC AI: guard reactions and combat behavior.

15
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Shots, damage and HUD updates
share the gameplay state.

16
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Secure G1 by eliminating its three guards.

17
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:50,000
The checkpoint circle unlocks after G1 is secured.

18
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Entering the circle asks for consent.
It does not automatically save.

19
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Press E at a safe standing boundary to save.
Health and ammo are preserved.

20
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:08,000
One shot after saving changes the ammo count.

21
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:12,000
F9 loads the saved checkpoint.
The actual loading interval is retained.

22
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:16,000
Saved ammo, health and mission state return.

23
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:21,000
Saved enemies restore in terminal death poses.
Death animations and sounds do not replay.

24
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:24,000
Separate run: defeat and restart.
A fresh mission begins with living guards.

25
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Enemy hits reduce the player's health.

26
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:36,000
The player is killed.
The mission enters MISSION LOST.

27
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:39,000
Press F6 to restart the mission.

28
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:43,000
A fresh mission restores the initial roster,
player health and starting ammo.

29
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:47,000
Current-build workload measurement is pending.
This script contains no new benchmark results.

30
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:51,000
The initial roster has six characters.
Higher NPC loads have not been verified here.

31
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Recorded video frame rate is not game FPS.
Measured stress evidence is still required.

32
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Next: performance, broader encounters
and second-machine verification.
